   Pennsylvania; Political Science Department at Brown University},
Funding-Text = {Melani Cammett is Professor of Government at Harvard University
   (mcammett@g.harvard.edu). Her research interests include the political
   economy of development, the politics of social welfare provision, and
   identity politics, with a regional focus on the Middle East and North
